# Build output and dev-server caches for this client.
#
# A NESTED ignore file rather than four more lines in the repo root's: this
# console was added under a hard "change no existing file" constraint (a
# concurrent session was editing the test suite), and git honours nested
# ignores exactly the same. `node_modules/` is already covered globally.
#
# Fold these into the root .gitignore alongside the `app/web/` entries
# whenever that file is next touched — one place is better, this is just not
# the moment to take it.
dist/
.vite/
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
